  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It seems that pressing the exit button, etc., after EAC has timed out and issued error code 30004, causes the entire PC to crash.\n\nThis is a problem that occurs in all EAC games, but VRC seems to be particularly prone to it, perhaps because it takes a long time to start up.\n\nWe believe that this is largely a problem with the implementation of EAC.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1154432088225890416/1154432170128068750/a4a57ff548934dbeba0cc7c62cdf9f34.7z?ex=651b83fd&is=651a327d&hm=a0c25fde4b4d63bd0caf8825d27732fe3e72a80cd4f706a446f38c9bcb743ea1&\n\n--\n\nEACがタイムアウトを起こして、エラーコード30004を出した後に終了ボタンなどを押すと、PCごとクラッシュを引き起こすようです。\n\nこれはあらゆるEACゲームで発生する問題ですが、VRCは特に起動にかかる時間が長いのか、発生しやすいように思います。\n\nこれはEACの実装による問題が大きいとみています。",
